@base=http://localhost:3000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### List policies
GET {{base}}/api/policies

### Filter auto policies
GET {{base}}/api/policies?productType=auto

### Create policy - valid
POST {{base}}/api/policies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyNumber": "FOX-AUTO-1002",
  "customerName": "Chris Johnson",
  "email": "chris@example.com",
  "productType": "auto",
  "premium": 1425,
  "status": "quoted",
  "effectiveDate": "2026-12-01"
}

### Create policy - invalid (validation demo)
POST {{base}}/api/policies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyNumber": "",
  "customerName": "",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "productType": "boat",
  "premium": -1,
  "effectiveDate": "not-a-date"
}

### Duplicate policyNumber (409 demo)
POST {{base}}/api/policies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyNumber": "FOX-AUTO-1001",
  "customerName": "Duplicate Demo",
  "email": "dup@example.com",
  "productType": "auto",
  "premium": 1000,
  "effectiveDate": "2026-12-01"
}

### Register admin
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@fox.com",
  "password": "FoxDemo123!",
  "role": "admin"
}

### Login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@fox.com",
  "password": "FoxDemo123!"
}
